'''Pirate Starter''' is the starting island for players who choose the [[Pirates]] team. It is one of only two islands in the [[First Sea]] designated as a [[Safe Zone]], meaning [[PvP mechanics|PvP]] is disabled, and it features non-boss [[enemies]]. If you go here and leave the game and choose Marines, you will automatically spawn at the [[Marine Starter]].

==Appearance==
The Pirate Starter features several houses arranged in a circular layout around a central grassy area. Surrounding this circle is a larger Ring of green grass, bordered by a rocky beach, which connects to a few docks. Near one of the windmills, there are two fields where the [[Bandit]]s spawn.

