==Trivia==
* If a player leaves the island still being level 1 there will appear a message on the inferior part of the screen telling to return to it
* Like the [[Pirate Recruiter]] on the [[Marine Starter]] island, the [[Marine Recruiter]] can be found on the Pirate Starter.
* Originally, Pirate Starter was intended to be larger, but it was reduced in size to avoid confusing new players.
* Pirate Starter is one of two starter islands in the game, along with [[Marine Starter Island]].
* Pirate Starter is one of the islands that features a map.
* Pirate Starter is the second smallest island in the [[First Sea]] before [[Jean-Luc Island]].
* Returning to or joining a friend in [[First Sea]] from the [[Second Sea]] or [[Third Sea]] as a [[Pirates|Pirate]] will teleport the player over to the Pirate Starter.
*If the player hasn't been to First Sea in some time their home point will also be set to Pirate Starter/[[Marine Starter]].

